--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope note (read before redistributing this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. This MIT grant covers the original source code of this project
   (Virus_Platform_Core/, webapp/, app.py, main.py, mcp_server.py, tests/,
   dev_tools/, docs/) and its documentation.

2. It does NOT cover third-party components bundled under 3rd/, nor the
   reference databases assembled under databases/. Every bundled tool and
   Python package keeps its own upstream license, and several are copyleft
   (e.g. SPAdes, IQ-TREE, salmon, samtools-related utilities, RDP5-related
   material, ViennaRNA). Redistributing a package that includes 3rd/
   therefore requires complying with those upstream licenses, including
   source-availability obligations where applicable.
   See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the component index and the per-component
   license files shipped in each directory; that file is generated by
   dev_tools/third_party_notices.py.

3. Reference sequence data under databases/ is derived from public
   repositories (NCBI/GenBank, ICTV taxonomy). Sequence records themselves
   are not copyrightable in most jurisdictions, but the assembled
   annotation/derived tables should be cited together with the upstream
   sources listed in the database manifests.

4. The benchmark inputs (VIROMOCK / Bari panels) are NOT redistributed here;
   they are obtained from their original sources (see
   docs/paper/benchmark/README and the manuscript's Data availability
   section).
